{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "9bc01eee-634f-47bc-ae59-b3912519b25c",
		"name": "Notification",
		"description": "Pruebas del API para el recurso Notification, anidado bajo el usuario destinatario: /users/{userId}/notifications.\n\nLa carpeta Preparacion crea dos veterinarios que hacen de usuarios (user_id_1, user_id_2). Ids que no existen: se usa 999999 (los ids <= 0 responden 412 'Notification id is not valid').\n\nLas pruebas de rango de fechas usan rangos amplios a proposito para no depender de la zona horaria.\n\nVariables globales que deja la coleccion: user_id_1, user_id_2, notification_id, notification_id_3.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Preparacion (usuarios destinatarios)",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Crear el usuario destinatario 1 (veterinario)",
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{baseUrl}}/veterinarians",
							"host": [
								"{{baseUrl}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"veterinarians"
							]
						},
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"firstName\": \"Laura\",\n    \"lastName\": \"Gomez\",\n    \"email\": \"{{user_email_1}}\",\n    \"phone\": \"3001234567\",\n    \"specialization\": \"Medicina general\",\n    \"availability\": \"Lunes a viernes 8:00-17:00\"\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						}
					},
					"response": [],
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "prerequest",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.globals.set(\"user_email_1\", \"usuario1.\" + Date.now() + \"@patitas.org\");"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						},
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"var data = pm.response.json()",
									"",
									"pm.globals.set(\"user_id_1\", data.id);",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {",
									"   pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					]
				},
